WEBVTT

00:43.626 --> 00:48.465
DOONA!

01:54.781 --> 01:55.782
Let's go back in.

02:44.122 --> 02:48.960
EPISODE 6
TWILIGHT ZONE

03:26.956 --> 03:28.291
Thank you!

03:28.833 --> 03:30.335
Thank you so much!

03:38.468 --> 03:41.888
It was so good
to have a decent workout after so long.

03:45.183 --> 03:47.352
- How long have you been doing it?
- Jiu-jitsu?

03:47.852 --> 03:49.229
This was my first time.

03:50.980 --> 03:51.981
You're pretty good.

03:52.065 --> 03:55.526
It's easy to think martial arts is
all about weight class,

03:55.610 --> 03:57.820
but actually, it's a matter of technique.

03:57.904 --> 03:59.322
How do you beat natural talent?

04:00.031 --> 04:01.074
You can't.

04:01.574 --> 04:03.868
So don't be discouraged. Chin up!

04:03.952 --> 04:08.039
You're good at yoga.
I've seen how insanely flexible you are.

04:09.123 --> 04:12.210
- Are you going to continue training here?
- Of course!

04:13.336 --> 04:17.173
I need to improve my combat power
if I'm going to beat up my asshole ex.

04:20.593 --> 04:21.427
What?

04:22.262 --> 04:25.348
Why bother beating up an asshole
who cheated on you? Just dump him.

04:26.349 --> 04:29.852
You can't fix a person like that.
People who hurt you will keep hurting you.

04:34.274 --> 04:37.568
Well, I'm not exactly thinking
of fixing him or anything,

04:38.820 --> 04:40.697
but point taken.

04:43.074 --> 04:43.908
Hey.

04:45.034 --> 04:46.202
Come on.

04:47.078 --> 04:50.123
DREAM SWEET TO RETURN
AS FOUR-PERSON GROUP WITHOUT DOONA

04:55.712 --> 04:58.047
What is it
that's so much more interesting than me?

04:58.131 --> 04:59.048
Your girlfriend?

04:59.132 --> 05:02.552
My Dream Sweet is finally
making a comeback!

05:03.594 --> 05:06.597
These headlines keep popping up,
so I was checking them out. Sorry.

05:06.681 --> 05:09.225
They're making a comeback
without the member named Doona?

05:09.309 --> 05:11.227
I'm not sure. We'll have to wait and see.

05:11.853 --> 05:14.355
Hey. Tell me about school.

05:15.231 --> 05:16.607
Anything going on with Jin-ju?

05:18.234 --> 05:19.986
What is Lee Doona like as a pop idol?

05:31.414 --> 05:33.916
LEE DOONA
LEE DOONA WITHDRAWAL, MOM'S DEBT

05:36.210 --> 05:39.630
IDOL DOONA'S PUBLIC IMAGE TAKES A HIT
AS HER MOM'S 700 MILLION DEBT REVEALED

05:42.008 --> 05:43.843
ONLINE FORUM FLOODED WITH POSTERS

05:43.926 --> 05:46.763
CLAIMING TO HAVE BEEN DEFRAUDED
BY DOONA'S MOTHER

05:50.099 --> 05:55.605
LEE DOONA'S MOM ALLEGED TO HAVE DEFRAUDED
VICTIMS OF OVER A BILLION WON

05:59.317 --> 06:00.985
DOONA'S PAINFUL PAST UNCOVERED

06:01.069 --> 06:03.488
RAISED BY GRANDMA FOLLOWING MOM'S DIVORCE

06:43.444 --> 06:44.320
Hey, it's me.

06:45.905 --> 06:46.739
Where are you?

06:47.698 --> 06:49.200
Outside a paper goods store.

06:51.786 --> 06:52.787
You're drunk.

06:53.496 --> 06:54.872
My dad

06:54.956 --> 06:56.749
ran a paper goods store.

06:56.833 --> 06:58.084
Do you know what that is?

06:59.419 --> 07:03.506
He sold wallpaper and paper flooring.
He repaired lamps.

07:03.589 --> 07:05.675
He basically did everything!

07:05.758 --> 07:06.676
Back then,

07:06.759 --> 07:08.886
there were so many things I wanted to do.

07:10.263 --> 07:12.098
But when Dad passed away,

07:13.266 --> 07:15.560
I suddenly lost interest
in all those things.

07:16.686 --> 07:19.730
Although I knew I'd never be as happy
as when he was around,

07:19.814 --> 07:22.150
I thought I'd try really hard

07:22.859 --> 07:25.278
to at least get as close as possible.

07:26.195 --> 07:29.991
And to achieve that goal, it was all right
if I didn't have anything I wanted to do.

07:30.491 --> 07:33.369
I developed a habit
of immediately giving up on anything

07:34.162 --> 07:36.539
that seemed out of reach.

07:40.293 --> 07:41.627
But…

07:43.754 --> 07:46.257
I can't help wanting more.

07:50.386 --> 07:52.221
What I mean is that I like you.

07:53.639 --> 07:55.099
I like you.

07:56.017 --> 07:58.561
I'm jealous of the men
you've liked in the past.

07:59.854 --> 08:01.439
I want to know your story.

08:04.734 --> 08:06.777
That's how I feel right now.

08:13.075 --> 08:14.660
That was too out of line.

08:21.459 --> 08:22.710
I'm sorry!

08:23.628 --> 08:24.587
I'm so sorry.

08:33.721 --> 08:34.805
I want to see you.

08:35.932 --> 08:36.807
Now.

09:34.115 --> 09:35.032
You actually came.

09:37.076 --> 09:38.536
I wanted to see you.

09:40.413 --> 09:42.206
I'm here, so go back to sleep.

10:49.690 --> 10:52.151
- Ta-da!
- Oh, sandwiches!

10:53.110 --> 10:56.197
- Why did you make so many?
- The bread was expiring.

10:56.280 --> 10:58.449
We brought them up to share with you guys.

11:01.702 --> 11:02.536
What about Doona?

11:02.620 --> 11:04.664
Oh, it looked like she was still sleeping,

11:04.747 --> 11:07.083
so we thought
we'd just go ahead and bring them up.

11:29.313 --> 11:30.272
What's this?

11:31.190 --> 11:33.275
Did you sleep with--

11:33.359 --> 11:35.361
I mean, are you dating Doona?

11:39.824 --> 11:40.741
I…

11:41.951 --> 11:42.785
like her.

11:57.216 --> 11:59.176
How long has this been going on for?

11:59.260 --> 12:02.304
She's strolling out of his room,
and he didn't let on once until now?

12:02.388 --> 12:04.390
Damn, what a traitor.

12:04.473 --> 12:05.891
I know.

12:05.975 --> 12:08.561
And when I asked him
whether they were dating,

12:09.145 --> 12:11.397
he said, "I like her."
What the hell is that?

12:12.732 --> 12:16.193
They're sleeping together,
but they're not dating.

12:16.277 --> 12:19.029
So actually, that's pretty cool.

12:19.113 --> 12:21.157
Just like people
in those American TV shows.

12:21.782 --> 12:23.909
That's not Won-jun's kind of thing.

12:29.290 --> 12:30.499
What's your opinion?

12:30.583 --> 12:33.461
Do you think it's possible
they're sleeping together but not dating?

12:33.544 --> 12:36.005
My opinion is
that it's a clear violation of the rules.

12:36.088 --> 12:37.798
I should have had a word with them.

12:38.799 --> 12:40.092
You're no fun at all.

12:43.220 --> 12:45.264
- How do live with someone like that?
- Him?

12:45.347 --> 12:47.808
I told you he's a heartless jerk.
I'm so sick of him.

13:04.867 --> 13:05.826
You've put on weight.

13:14.960 --> 13:16.879
Does your stylist live with you?

13:19.715 --> 13:21.383
They're just my friends.

13:21.967 --> 13:24.220
You don't have any friends.

13:25.596 --> 13:26.472
I do now.

13:27.681 --> 13:28.724
Why are you here?

13:29.809 --> 13:34.313
I heard the others are making a comeback.
Are you just going to sit by like this?

13:35.064 --> 13:36.357
Why, you worried?

13:36.899 --> 13:40.069
You need to get the rest of your money.
The outstanding balance.

13:40.569 --> 13:42.196
There isn't anything outstanding.

13:42.279 --> 13:44.740
I got everything,
and I gave you everything.

13:45.241 --> 13:47.910
You should know
since you're the one who blew it all.

13:50.329 --> 13:52.164
So go back.

13:52.248 --> 13:53.249
And grovel.

13:56.418 --> 13:59.630
Do you know why I quit, Mom?

13:59.713 --> 14:01.423
Are you even curious to know?

14:01.507 --> 14:03.467
I'm not curious because I already know.

14:05.010 --> 14:08.514
It's because you have no grit,
and you have a shitty temper.

14:08.597 --> 14:10.432
You only do things that repel others.

14:23.445 --> 14:25.364
- Is Alice sick?
- I'm sorry?

14:25.447 --> 14:27.449
She suddenly said
she couldn't come in today.

14:27.533 --> 14:28.701
Did she not contact you?

14:30.911 --> 14:32.121
No, she didn't.

14:32.705 --> 14:35.541
Did something happen to her?
This isn't like her.

14:42.631 --> 14:44.592
- Welcome.
- Hello.

15:05.779 --> 15:08.782
10 YEARS LATER GROUND

15:22.129 --> 15:23.672
KIM JIN-JU

15:32.514 --> 15:33.349
Hey.

15:35.601 --> 15:36.435
Sorry.

15:37.353 --> 15:39.396
It must have been tough today on your own.

15:40.773 --> 15:42.775
No, things were pretty slow today.

15:43.442 --> 15:45.611
I hear there are fireworks today.

15:46.111 --> 15:47.321
Jin-ju.

15:48.113 --> 15:49.615
Want to go watch them with me?

15:51.158 --> 15:52.451
Just come.

15:53.369 --> 15:55.204
I have something to say to you.

15:57.247 --> 15:58.332
Please just come.

16:06.882 --> 16:09.301
Fireworks. Seriously? We're not children.

16:10.094 --> 16:11.720
Could you please shut up?

16:12.721 --> 16:15.349
I'm feeling very blue right now.

16:16.183 --> 16:17.476
Blue? Why?

16:17.559 --> 16:21.105
This guy that I like
seems to have no interest in me.

16:21.188 --> 16:23.941
Really? Who is it?

16:26.944 --> 16:29.863
- Wow, look!
- They're starting! Oh my God!

16:29.947 --> 16:31.240
That's awesome!

16:49.049 --> 16:50.426
About that guy,

16:51.510 --> 16:54.680
not that I know who he is.
I definitely don't know who he is.

16:55.347 --> 16:58.308
But it could be
that he has some kind of trauma

16:58.392 --> 17:01.979
when it comes to love
due to repeated failures.

17:04.440 --> 17:07.443
I don't care.
I like him, so what does it matter?

17:09.403 --> 17:10.237
What?

17:16.285 --> 17:18.829
- That's really nice.
- Right? It's so pretty.

17:19.538 --> 17:22.124
- It sure is.
- Look, it's a love heart.

17:26.295 --> 17:28.714
- Let's go.
- That's so pretty.

17:33.552 --> 17:34.428
That's nice.

17:34.928 --> 17:37.014
I haven't seen fireworks in ages.

17:43.062 --> 17:45.981
- So pretty.
- That's really pretty.

17:47.733 --> 17:50.194
- So pretty!
- They're beautiful!

17:56.825 --> 17:58.118
It's already started.

17:58.994 --> 18:01.246
Isn't this what you invited me to?

18:02.039 --> 18:02.956
I know.

18:03.624 --> 18:06.210
Sorry I'm late
when I'm the one who invited you out.

18:07.461 --> 18:09.088
Enjoy it before it ends.

18:21.767 --> 18:22.768
Won-jun,

18:23.852 --> 18:26.188
I'm going to say something important,

18:26.688 --> 18:30.025
so keep your eyes on the fireworks,
and don't look at me. Okay?

18:36.573 --> 18:37.950
I like you.

18:41.495 --> 18:43.413
I told you not to look at me.

18:44.164 --> 18:45.457
I'm not done yet.

18:48.502 --> 18:50.754
I've liked you
since the first time I met you.

18:52.172 --> 18:54.758
Because you looked so cool
solving the math problem.

18:55.509 --> 18:56.510
Isn't that funny?

18:59.555 --> 19:01.682
1ST PLACE YANGJIN HIGH SCHOOL LEE WON-JUN

19:09.398 --> 19:10.899
LEE WON-JUN

19:44.892 --> 19:47.603
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

19:49.271 --> 19:51.273
I hear you're good at math.

19:52.274 --> 19:53.984
Could you help me with this?

20:02.284 --> 20:05.913
"In the inscribed quadrilateral ABCD
as shown in the diagram,

20:05.996 --> 20:08.790
find out the length of side BC
when side AB is…"

20:11.043 --> 20:12.044
Here.

20:13.754 --> 20:15.839
Triangle…

20:23.096 --> 20:24.848
Oh, I have to go.

20:26.683 --> 20:28.894
Can I come to you for help
with other problems?

20:29.394 --> 20:30.479
Sure.

20:30.562 --> 20:33.357
OSEONG ACADEMY

20:34.399 --> 20:36.944
At a time when even breathing
seemed too much,

20:38.153 --> 20:41.657
I felt like I could finally breathe
when I was talking with you.

20:41.740 --> 20:42.950
Rock, paper, scissors!

20:43.033 --> 20:45.410
And every day, walking home together,

20:48.538 --> 20:50.207
I'd wish I lived further away.

20:50.290 --> 20:51.583
Hey! Lee Won-jun!

20:53.293 --> 20:55.087
I'd think things like that.

20:56.922 --> 21:01.301
I'd get butterflies in my stomach,
and my heart would ache and flutter.

21:05.055 --> 21:07.641
Three, two, one.

21:14.147 --> 21:15.774
I felt the same as you.

21:17.150 --> 21:19.069
I like that! Soulmates.

21:19.987 --> 21:23.532
I couldn't tell you how I felt.
I didn't want things to get awkward.

21:28.704 --> 21:31.123
I was scared
we wouldn't even stay friends.

21:35.502 --> 21:37.004
OKAY, TAKE CARE

21:38.797 --> 21:41.633
Because I didn't have the guts
to tell you who I really am.

21:51.852 --> 21:54.062
I know you've already turned me down,

21:55.897 --> 21:58.191
but I'm telling you
in case I regret not saying it.

22:00.319 --> 22:01.737
I like you.

22:03.530 --> 22:06.908
I've liked you
from the moment we first met…

22:09.244 --> 22:10.495
and I still do now.

22:35.604 --> 22:38.065
I can hear the tick-tockl

22:38.857 --> 22:40.942
My look shines through

22:42.110 --> 22:43.612
Look at you now

22:44.363 --> 22:46.031
Who cares?
I'm a star

22:46.114 --> 22:47.574
This here is my ground

22:48.408 --> 22:51.703
I dazzle as I run the show
Whatever others say, I don't care

22:52.204 --> 22:56.583
Follow melodies to wonderland
That you have wished for

22:58.919 --> 23:00.670
La papa loom pow

23:02.506 --> 23:04.466
I'm sassy as I go my way

23:07.010 --> 23:08.804
I'm breaking my cage

23:10.430 --> 23:12.682
Just follow my step

23:16.019 --> 23:18.021
Let's dance…

23:27.280 --> 23:28.240
Thank you.

23:30.909 --> 23:32.661
That's something

23:33.578 --> 23:36.081
I've desperately wanted to hear
for a very long time.

23:36.665 --> 23:37.833
And I'm sorry.

23:38.500 --> 23:40.419
I'm sorry I was too young then.

23:41.461 --> 23:43.505
I'm sorry that all I did was hesitate.

23:46.049 --> 23:47.259
And I'm sorry…

23:47.968 --> 23:49.803
that I don't feel
the same way as you anymore.

23:55.517 --> 23:57.936
I hope Doona dumps you.

23:58.520 --> 24:02.149
Even if you end up covered in wounds
and full of regret, I won't take you back.

24:02.899 --> 24:05.318
There are plenty of guys
who like me, you know?

24:06.778 --> 24:07.654
I know.

24:08.989 --> 24:12.075
You're the kind of person
anyone would like. I was one of them.

24:14.619 --> 24:18.707
So don't let anyone treat you badly,

24:19.791 --> 24:22.002
not even family.

24:22.502 --> 24:24.254
You don't have to put up with that.

24:27.007 --> 24:28.842
And I wanted to tell you this.

24:30.051 --> 24:33.763
Good for you that you've decided
not to put up with things anymore.

24:33.847 --> 24:35.390
Whatever they happen to be.

25:02.792 --> 25:04.294
It's all over.

25:12.469 --> 25:14.888
You came to the showcase today,
didn't you?

25:35.742 --> 25:40.914
The number you're trying to reach
is unavailable. Please try again later.

25:40.997 --> 25:43.250
RECENTS

25:43.333 --> 25:44.251
LEE DOONA

25:50.257 --> 25:52.300
What are you doing
in the middle of the night?

25:54.719 --> 25:57.305
Nothing. Just hanging out.
Why are you out here?

25:57.389 --> 26:00.350
Well, I was just out on a walk
because I couldn't sleep,

26:00.433 --> 26:01.601
and then I saw you.

26:02.936 --> 26:04.563
Go back in and go to bed.

26:08.650 --> 26:09.484
Hey.

26:10.610 --> 26:14.864
Jin-ju's moved out.
She's moving into a mini-studio.

26:16.283 --> 26:17.242
I know.

26:18.076 --> 26:19.077
Because of you?

26:25.333 --> 26:28.295
Why isn't Doona back yet?

26:28.378 --> 26:29.754
How would I know?

26:31.423 --> 26:34.050
She's your girlfriend.
Who else is supposed to know?

26:35.677 --> 26:36.803
Girlfriend…

26:40.348 --> 26:41.182
Isn't she?

26:45.186 --> 26:47.230
Oh, you're such an idiot. Jeez!

26:51.484 --> 26:52.319
Yo!

26:56.698 --> 26:58.283
Come on!

27:08.543 --> 27:09.461
Lee Won-jun.

27:10.128 --> 27:12.297
Do you know why couples do things like

27:12.380 --> 27:15.133
defining Day One of a relationship
and other childish stuff?

27:15.634 --> 27:17.052
Relationships are contracts.

27:18.094 --> 27:20.263
It's only natural
to want to define the terms.

27:20.847 --> 27:22.223
But in my experience,

27:22.807 --> 27:24.517
gut feelings are accurate.

27:25.602 --> 27:27.312
She must have her reasons.

27:27.395 --> 27:29.648
She is a celebrity after all.

27:39.824 --> 27:41.868
Don't give too much of yourself.

27:51.002 --> 27:51.878
Want a hug?

27:53.171 --> 27:54.172
No, thanks.

27:57.926 --> 27:58.760
Right.

28:02.055 --> 28:03.014
Chin up!

28:03.848 --> 28:05.809
Shall I be off, then?

28:06.309 --> 28:07.310
Get some sleep.

28:08.853 --> 28:09.688
All right.

28:15.026 --> 28:16.778
Sure you don't want a hug?

28:26.204 --> 28:27.247
You'll regret it!

28:39.926 --> 28:41.636
LEE DOONA

28:41.720 --> 28:43.304
Where are you?

29:18.673 --> 29:21.426
Don't touch that cat. It's filthy.

29:28.641 --> 29:31.603
Are you here? No, I'll be right out.

29:32.103 --> 29:34.647
Yes, I'll be there.
Just give me a sec. Bye.

29:42.906 --> 29:43.823
Doona.

29:46.534 --> 29:47.869
What are you doing here?

29:49.412 --> 29:50.747
Let's go on a trip.

29:50.830 --> 29:52.957
- What?
- Why, don't you want to?

29:53.917 --> 29:55.126
No, it's not that…

29:56.127 --> 29:57.253
Let's go, then.

30:41.631 --> 30:42.465
Hurry up!

30:54.602 --> 30:55.562
Isn't it Won-jun?

30:58.857 --> 31:02.610
Well, statistically,
that is a possibility.

31:03.444 --> 31:04.404
But look.

31:05.905 --> 31:07.490
You know, I'm a Psychology major.

31:07.574 --> 31:10.034
When I analyze

31:10.118 --> 31:14.038
the countless non-verbal signs
I-ra is sending me…

31:17.917 --> 31:19.127
I think it's me.

31:19.210 --> 31:20.044
For sure.

31:28.511 --> 31:32.682
This is so uncomfortable,
living under the same roof and all.

31:35.977 --> 31:36.978
Choi I-ra.

31:56.915 --> 31:58.541
This is nice.

32:05.131 --> 32:06.549
Hey! Quick!

32:08.343 --> 32:09.302
Oh God!

32:10.428 --> 32:12.138
Just ditch it here!

32:16.017 --> 32:17.977
- It's cold.
- I can't believe this.

32:22.690 --> 32:23.942
Can I have a towel?

32:31.115 --> 32:33.451
Hey, can you help me with this?

32:35.203 --> 32:37.664
This. Come on, hurry up!

32:40.041 --> 32:40.875
Come on!

37:32.375 --> 37:33.417
Jeong-hun!

37:37.004 --> 37:40.591
Where are you going?
We're training. Are you scared of me?

37:41.425 --> 37:42.426
Come at me!

38:12.915 --> 38:14.542
Find another training hall.

38:24.385 --> 38:25.636
Jeong-hun!

38:26.304 --> 38:28.889
Let's go for beef intestines. It's on me.

38:30.099 --> 38:31.600
Come on, Gu Jeong-hun.

38:31.684 --> 38:34.270
Let's go for beef intestines!
I said I'm buying!

38:34.353 --> 38:35.980
- Seriously.
- Look, I'm treating you!

38:36.063 --> 38:40.443
- Why is Won-jun friends with her?
- Look, I have something to say to you!

38:51.245 --> 38:52.371
What's she doing?

39:10.139 --> 39:11.265
Let's go.

39:11.974 --> 39:14.310
Come on.
You wanted beef intestines, didn't you?

39:20.941 --> 39:23.277
I don't have any feelings left for him,

39:23.986 --> 39:27.073
but actually seeing him with someone else
makes me want to kill him.

39:29.784 --> 39:32.703
We were together for eight years
since we were kids.

39:33.621 --> 39:35.331
What happens to all those years now?

39:35.414 --> 39:37.041
You can't get those years back,

39:38.250 --> 39:40.586
but get your money back.
Didn't you lend him money?

39:41.670 --> 39:43.047
So annoying.

39:47.718 --> 39:50.888
I'm curious
about people like you and Yun-taek.

39:51.472 --> 39:54.517
You get hurt every single time,
but you still chase after love? Why?

39:54.600 --> 39:56.394
Wouldn't it be easier not to?

39:57.061 --> 39:58.396
You don't understand.

39:58.479 --> 40:02.525
You don't choose to like someone.
It just happens. Like an accident.

40:05.069 --> 40:06.529
I just don't understand.

40:06.612 --> 40:09.824
Someday, there will come a moment
when you do.

40:13.953 --> 40:15.287
Go for it. It's ready.

40:16.080 --> 40:17.623
I have no appetite.

40:18.416 --> 40:20.376
You still need to eat. Eat up.

40:27.258 --> 40:28.342
This place is great!

40:28.426 --> 40:29.802
This is so good!

40:31.178 --> 40:32.012
Let's toast.

40:37.935 --> 40:39.562
I love this place!

40:42.648 --> 40:45.317
Lettuce! The second bite
will be with lettuce.

40:47.486 --> 40:49.864
- Why aren't you eating?
- Oh, I will.

40:52.408 --> 40:54.743
The second bite is even better.
It's awesome!

40:55.369 --> 40:57.204
- This place is insane!
- What was that?

40:57.705 --> 40:59.540
- I can't understand.
- It's so good.

40:59.623 --> 41:01.292
All right. Slow down.

41:01.375 --> 41:03.752
Do you even know how good this tastes?

41:16.724 --> 41:18.225
When are we heading back?

41:19.101 --> 41:19.935
Why?

41:20.603 --> 41:21.770
Do you miss home?

41:21.854 --> 41:23.814
No, I want to stay here longer.

41:24.940 --> 41:27.485
I want to just live here
with you like this.

41:29.653 --> 41:33.741
It's nice to hear you say
you want to do something.

41:38.078 --> 41:41.749
Should we start dating for real?
Like, let the whole world know and all?

41:46.462 --> 41:48.547
What? You don't have the nerve?

41:48.631 --> 41:49.632
On the contrary.

41:51.091 --> 41:52.009
I'm elated.

41:56.347 --> 41:58.140
What shall we make for dinner?

43:16.802 --> 43:20.598
MSA HEAD OF TALENT RECRUITMENT
PARK IN-WOOK

43:25.978 --> 43:27.271
I'll go to Seoul.

45:49.747 --> 45:54.752
Subtitle translation by: Reuben Simpson
